<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-10 mb-4">Bottom line</h2>

<p class="mb-4">GLM-5.3 on Workers AI is the most capable open-weights coding model you can call today at $1.40/M input. The benchmark deltas against GLM-5.2 — Terminal Bench 3.0 6.1x, SWE-Marathon 2.2x, CyberGym 84.5 — are real and they came from post-training only, so the upgrade is a one-line model-ID swap for any existing GLM-5.2 deployment.</p>

